    "terrainName": "berlin",
    "description": "What: Simulated devices SD-S4 (DESIGN_Simulated_Devices 3.13b D-112; the twin of dv-sight-procedure with the launcher authored EMPTY). The scripted trainee powers the TOW's sight unit, waits out the self-test, presses ARM, FIRE and ARM again, and presses ARM inside a 60-frame pause. Judge: (1) the unit reaches STANDBY and stays there; (2) it never arms (ARM is refused on an empty launcher - in the pause too, and never remembered), never reads READY or GUIDING, and nothing is launched; (3) MISSILES reads 0 (the HUD's NO MISSILE - the HUD rows wait for its projector). Fail: ARMED, READY, GUIDING or a shot. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh dv-sight-empty"
